# Consumer .npmrc — copy this to `.npmrc` in the root of any app that installs
# @dhspl-tatvacare/tesseract-ui from the org's PRIVATE GitHub Packages registry.
#
# It does two things:
#   1. Route the @dhspl-tatvacare scope to GitHub's private npm registry.
#   2. Authenticate with a token that has `read:packages` (gated by org access).
#
# Do NOT paste the token here — reference an env var so the secret never lands in git:
#   export NPM_TOKEN=<read:packages token>   (locally, in your shell profile)
#   in CI / Azure: expose it as the NPM_TOKEN secret / build-arg / env var.

@dhspl-tatvacare:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
